# Copy to .env (gitignored) in the same directory as docker-compose.yml
# and fill in real values. Compose's `env_file` stanza in
# docker-compose.yml turns every KEY=value line here into a container
# environment variable.
#
# This file has no single narrow owner -- more than one Skill in this
# suite can need a line here (devcontainer-git-auth's GH_TOKEN is the
# first). Append your own key with a one-line comment saying which Skill
# needs it and why, rather than replacing what's already here.

# devcontainer-git-auth: fine-grained GitHub PAT for the `gh` CLI's own
# API operations (deploy-key registration, PRs, issues). Not involved in
# git transport -- that's the deploy key, an SSH keypair generated inside
# the container, not a value that belongs in this file at all.
# GH_TOKEN=
